		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-233a829b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="233a829b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3d225b49 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="3d225b49" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Laparoscopic &amp; Laser Surgeries </h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b4d9373 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="b4d9373" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="938" height="625" src="https://slsshospitals.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Laparoscopic-Laser-Surgeries-1.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-image-11939" alt="" srcset="https://slsshospitals.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Laparoscopic-Laser-Surgeries-1.png 938w, https://slsshospitals.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Laparoscopic-Laser-Surgeries-1-300x200.png 300w, https://slsshospitals.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Laparoscopic-Laser-Surgeries-1-768x512.png 768w, https://slsshospitals.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Laparoscopic-Laser-Surgeries-1-370x247.png 370w, https://slsshospitals.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Laparoscopic-Laser-Surgeries-1-270x180.png 270w" sizes="(max-width: 938px) 100vw, 938px" />															</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4ad76610 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4ad76610" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Sri Lakshmi Super Speciality Hospital is at the forefront of offering advanced Laparoscopic and Laser Surgery services, providing minimally invasive surgical options that offer numerous benefits over traditional open surgeries. These cutting-edge techniques are performed by skilled surgeons using state-of-the-art equipment, ensuring precision, minimal discomfort, and faster recovery for patients.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-395c7d38 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="395c7d38" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Laparoscopic procedures require smaller incisions compared to traditional open surgery, which reduces trauma to surrounding tissues, minimizes scarring, and accelerates healing.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-731fd5e6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="731fd5e6" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}">
